skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
hide footbox

legend bottom
  Informative response-signing proposal; successful requests only.
  The response signature alone does not prove an unchanged history.
endlegend

actor "Requester" as User
participant "DPP service" as DPP #FFF2CC
participant "DPP IAM" as IAM #FFF2CC
participant "AAS service" as AAS #D9EAF7

User -> DPP : Read DPP by product ID and date\nAccept-Signature (optional)
alt Authenticated access
  DPP -> IAM : Authenticate requester
  IAM --> DPP : AAS access token for role
  DPP -> AAS : Read historic DPP data with token
  AAS -> AAS : Validate access token and trusted claims
else Public access
  DPP -> AAS : Read public historic DPP data\nwithout access token
end
AAS -> AAS : Authorize read: example 1 (public),\n2 (recycler), or 4 (authority)\nRetrieve selected version
AAS --> DPP : Historic DPP data
DPP -> DPP : Sign response only when requested
DPP --> User : Historic DPP data\nContent-Digest + Signature-Input + Signature (when requested)
@enduml
